.TH MYSTRLEN 1 "September 2026" "MyUtils" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mystrlen
.BI "const char *str"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrlen function calculates and returns the number of characters
in the given string, excluding the terminating null character.
.SH AUTHOR
Eras Tariq
